sequenceDiagram
    participant ESP as ESP32
    participant GSM as SIM800L
    participant API as FastAPI (VPS)
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant WS as WebSocket
    participant BR as Browser

    note over ESP: Every 5 seconds
    ESP->>ESP: Drain MCP2515 CAN buffer
    ESP->>ESP: decodeFrame() × N
    ESP->>ESP: buildJSON()
    ESP->>GSM: AT+HTTPINIT / AT+HTTPPARA
    ESP->>GSM: AT+HTTPDATA (JSON payload)
    ESP->>GSM: AT+HTTPACTION=1 (POST)
    GSM->>API: POST /api/ingest
    API->>DB: INSERT INTO snapshots
    DB-->>API: rowid
    API-->>GSM: 200 OK
    GSM-->>ESP: +HTTPACTION:1,200,N
    API--)WS: broadcast(snapshot)
    WS--)BR: JSON push (≤2 s)
    BR->>BR: Render dashboard
